{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04482","headline":"宿襄河驿浦 · 陈子昂","name":"宿襄河驿浦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沿流辞北渚，结缆宿南洲。\n合岸昏初夕，廻塘暗不流。\n卧闻塞鸿断，坐听峡猿愁。\n沙浦明如月，汀葭晦若秋。\n不及能鸣雁，徒思海上鸥。\n天河殊未晓，沧海信悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04482.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04482","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}